  "description": "A short, thick-forearmed woman with a burn scar that climbs out of her collar and stops just under her jaw, and the permanent squint of somebody who has looked into a forge for a living. She talks to you while working and does not stop working.",
  "dialogue_tree": {
    "bye": {
      "text": "She is already back at the wheel."
    },
    "green": {
      "options": [
        {
          "next": "root",
          "text": "Fair enough."
        }
      ],
      "text": "\"Then take the leaf-spring off the rack by the door. It's free, it's rubbish, and it'll teach you more in a month than that,\" and she nods at the glass case, \"will teach you in a year. Come back when you've stopped cutting yourself.\""
    },
    "marques": {
      "options": [
        {
          "next": "root",
          "text": "Noted."
        }
      ],
      "text": "\"House work is mine. The Trueline. Circle mark on every one, signature on the ones that earned it. Redlaw is transit-warden surplus, good steel, boring. Blackvane is behind the glass and you can look at it.\" She pauses. \"And if somebody in the Reach offers you a Blackvane with a motor on it, that is a decal and a chainsaw and your own business.\""
    },
    "root": {
      "options": [
        {
          "next": "shop",
          "text": "Let me see what you have."
        },
        {
          "next": "green",
          "text": "I don't know one end from the other."
        },
        {
          "next": "marques",
          "text": "Who makes these?"
        }
      ],
      "text": "\"Mind the floor, it's all grit.\" She sets something glowing back into the coals. \"You after an edge, or just warm?\""
    },
    "shop": {
      "action": "OPEN_SHOP",
      "next": "bye",
      "text": "She wipes her hands and lifts the counter flap."
    }
  },
  "flags": {
    "clothing_layers": [
      "a scorched leather forge apron, scarred white where sparks have landed",
      "a sleeveless work shirt gone grey at the seams",
      "a plain sports bra and cotton shorts"
